From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matt DeVillier <matt.devillier@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Aug 2024 09:05:32 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] UefiPayloadPkg: Add and use PlatformGopPolicy

[ouroBIOS: commit 076933b90058 of MrChromebox's edk2, without the files
that TianoCore's tree does not have (tools/edk2-import.py): 5 in
edk2/OuroBiosPkg]

Add PlatformGopPolicy to use external GOP driver. Use it in place of
GraphicsOutputDxe if command line param passed.

Revert "UefiPayloadPkg/Gop: Clean up unused protocol and Guid"
as it's needed for PlatformGopPolicy.

Signed-off-by: Matt DeVillier <matt.devillier@gmail.com>
---
 UefiPayloadPkg/UefiPayloadPkg.dec | 10 ++++++++++
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+)

